00:00:59.037 --> 00:01:00.203
LORIN PRICE: That's awesome.

00:01:00.203 --> 00:01:01.910
Congrats on the ML
Partner of the Year

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:04.610
and for being a
CCAI launch partner.

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:06.832
Can you tell us a
bit more about CCAI

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:08.540
