be a launch partner?

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:09.248
TAYLOR CYR: Yeah.

00:01:09.248 --> 00:01:10.940
So there's three
components to CCAI.

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:12.860
There's a topic
modeler, which uses

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.760
keyword clustering to identify
high-frequency topics.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:18.950
There's Dialogflow,
which is the NLP

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:22.170
